1
00:00:05,709 --> 00:00:13,719
Thus, the prince and the princess were wed,
and they lived happily ever after.

2
00:00:14,589 --> 00:00:19,229
Mother, did nothing sad ever happen to them again?

3
00:00:19,229 --> 00:00:24,509
Let me see. They probably went through
sad times and painful times as well.

4
00:00:24,509 --> 00:00:27,609
But, as long as they were together,
they could overcome it.

5
00:00:28,299 --> 00:00:29,609
Really?

6
00:00:30,019 --> 00:00:31,619
Really.

7
00:00:32,189 --> 00:00:33,869
But what if they weren't together?

8
00:00:36,619 --> 00:00:40,119
For something like that
I'll teach you a secret magic spell.

9
00:00:40,569 --> 00:00:42,219
A magic spell?

10
00:00:42,219 --> 00:00:46,879
When this is said, both the prince and the princess
will live happily ever after.

11
00:00:49,879 --> 00:00:54,899
But, this spell only works on someone <i>really</i> special.

12
00:00:54,899 --> 00:00:59,259
You absolutely can not use them until you meet that person.

13
00:00:59,859 --> 00:01:01,809
Got it, Mother!

